    {
      "id": "7F0E8CA5023FA045",
      "title": "Start an Arcane Material Reserve",
      "description": [
        "Gather 8 Arcane Essence by hunting magical enemies and looting structures, then keep a reserve for your workshop. Essence feeds robes, staves, cloth and ingots, so inspect its JEI uses before spending your last pieces."
      ],
