    {
      "id": "28A098890C8585BF",
      "title": "Instant, Charged and Recast Spells",
      "description": [
        "Read a spell's cast type, mana cost, cast time and cooldown before committing to an attack. Practice an instant cast, a longer cast or channel, and any recast prompts your chosen spell provides; acknowledge this lesson after testing rather than treating the checkmark as automatic cast detection."
